title: Breakdown
---
<<fade_out YarnCommands 0>><<wait 1>><<picture YarnCommands placeholder>><<picture_color YarnCommands black>><<fade_in YarnCommands 1>><<bloom_text YarnCommands "Breakdown">>
Your heart begins to pound faster and faster.
The world around you darkens as a thick fog closes in.
You clutch your chest and sink to your knees, breathing heavily as panic takes hold.
The darkness is close. Closer than you think...
<<roll_breakdown>>
<<if breakdown_stat() == "Proficiency">>
    You feel your hard-earned discipline slipping away.
<<elseif breakdown_stat() == "Wisdom">>
    The thoughts you once trusted become distant and unclear.
<<elseif breakdown_stat() == "Arcana">>
    Your mana circuits goes haywire. Flickering and fading away.
<<elseif breakdown_stat() == "Abundance">>
    Your sense of keenness drains away, leaving you feeling unprepared.
<<elseif breakdown_stat() == "Affinity">>
    The connections you have built begin to weaken.
<<elseif breakdown_stat() == "Metabolism">>
    Your body's hard-won vitality falters beneath the pressure.
<<else>>
    You search for something to hold on to, but the darkness finds no weakness to exploit, for you already are.
<<endif>>
<<if breakdown_stat() == "Proficiency">>
    <<jump breakdown_proficiency>>
<<elseif breakdown_stat() == "Wisdom">>
    <<jump breakdown_wisdom>>
<<elseif breakdown_stat() == "Arcana">>
    <<jump breakdown_arcana>>
<<elseif breakdown_stat() == "Abundance">>
    <<jump breakdown_abundance>>
<<elseif breakdown_stat() == "Affinity">>
    <<jump breakdown_affinity>>
<<elseif breakdown_stat() == "Metabolism">>
    <<jump breakdown_metabolism>>
<<else>>
    <<jump breakdown_end>>
<<endif>>
===

title: breakdown_proficiency
---
-> Breakdown #paneldetails=Lose_4_Proficiency
    <<apply_breakdown>><<jump breakdown_end>>
-> [gold]I am strong. I am resolute.[/gold] <<if insight() >= 1>> #paneldetails=Spend_1_Insight_to_negate_the_loss
    <<spend_insight 1>><<negate_breakdown>><<jump breakdown_negated>>
===

