title: breakdown_end
---
<<picture_color YarnCommands white>>
The fog recedes slowly, leaving you shaken and diminished.
<<hide_speaker_frame YarnCommands>><<wait 1>><<fade_out YarnCommands 2>><<load_map_scene>>
===

title: breakdown_negated
---
You grit your teeth and force yourself to take a deep breath.
<<picture_color YarnCommands white>>
The darkness loosens its grip.
The panic subsides without taking anything from you.
<<hide_speaker_frame YarnCommands>><<wait 1>><<fade_out YarnCommands 2>><<load_map_scene>>
===
